{"id":"H5820","lemma":"עַזְמָ֫וֶת","transliteration":"azmavet","sayIt":"az-MA-vet","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Azmaveth","meaning":"A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.23.31\n§ Azmaveth = \"strong unto death\"\n1) one of David's mighty warriors\n2) a descendant of Mephibosheth, the son of Jonathan and grandson of king Saul\n3) a Benjamite, father of Jeziel and Pelet who were two of David's men who joined him at Ziklag\n4) overseer of the royal treasures in the reign of David\n5) a place in Benjamin; also 'Beth-azmeveth'","glosses":["azmaveth"],"count":8,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-23","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azmaveth","kjv":"Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azmaveth","kjv":"and Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azmaveth","kjv":"and Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-11","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azmaveth","kjv":"Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-12","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Azmaveth","kjv":"of Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-27","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azmaveth","kjv":"was Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-2","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Azmaveth","kjv":"of Azmaveth"}},{"chapterId":"neh-12","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Azmaveth","kjv":"and Azmaveth"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Samuel 23:31","note":"Abialbon the Arbathite, Azmaveth the Barhumite,","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:36","note":"Ahaz became the father of Jehoaddah. Jehoaddah became the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri. Zimri became the father of Moza.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 2:24","note":"The children of Azmaveth, forty-two.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 12:29","note":"also from Beth Gilgal, and out of the fields of Geba and Azmaveth: for the singers had built themselves villages around Jerusalem.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1041","lemma":"בֵּית־עַזְמָ֫וֶת","transliteration":"bet azmavet","gloss":"Beth-azmaveth"},{"id":"H2174","lemma":"זִמְרִי","transliteration"